{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Jo, guess what I did? Dyed my hair last week - come see!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-a3a25679aabddd96fb91d166", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:38:50.475402+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a3a25679aabddd96fb91d166", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a3a25679aabddd96fb91d166", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, Nate! Can't wait to see it. Must feel so liberating! How're you feeling?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-d7c062b7e0ca90b453df7eb7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:38:54.629446+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d7c062b7e0ca90b453df7eb7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d7c062b7e0ca90b453df7eb7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I'm so stoked about it! Check it out!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-a961a3cf7887025a2c87b44e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:38:58.806829+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a961a3cf7887025a2c87b44e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a961a3cf7887025a2c87b44e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, your new hair color looks amazing! What made you choose that shade? Tell me all about it!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-33714373a2b8a1c1af42bfcd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T13:39:03.003131+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "33714373a2b8a1c1af42bfcd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "33714373a2b8a1c1af42bfcd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks Jo! I picked this color because it's bright and bold - like me! I wanted to stand out from the regular options."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-229e5221e961b60f74586b7e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:22.013088+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "229e5221e961b60f74586b7e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "229e5221e961b60f74586b7e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That's amazing, Nate! Your boldness really inspired me. It reminded me of this gorgeous sunset I saw while hiking the other day. It made me realize the importance of showing the world who we are."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-24e4bcd09a458629d2c4145d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:26.191448+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "24e4bcd09a458629d2c4145d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "24e4bcd09a458629d2c4145d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, that sunset looks awesome! Jealous! I bet you had a great time. Are there any more exciting trips coming up for you?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-ff578093f0db2eb501c18d97", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:30.273860+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ff578093f0db2eb501c18d97", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ff578093f0db2eb501c18d97", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I did! the sky was so gorgeous! Wish I had a vacation lined up, but right now my writing is consuming me. Hoping for some good news soon!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-0626b8df3c5bc262ffed1957", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:34.385833+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0626b8df3c5bc262ffed1957", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0626b8df3c5bc262ffed1957", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I understand, Joanna. Big projects can be so taxing. Keep me posted on how it goes, alright?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-e4265bf449fea7e4fe0a41f3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:38.498736+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e4265bf449fea7e4fe0a41f3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e4265bf449fea7e4fe0a41f3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Cheers, Nate! Your support means a lot. I'll definitely keep you updated."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-86a5c2c7a7ffae5b402cc320", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:42.587354+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "86a5c2c7a7ffae5b402cc320", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "86a5c2c7a7ffae5b402cc320", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Sounds great, See you soon?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-131f43ea70ed8655eeead64b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:46.715880+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "131f43ea70ed8655eeead64b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "131f43ea70ed8655eeead64b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Totally! Bye Nate!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-AMEM_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_7-5e326f2ef74b9e695582aa91", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T14:05:50.851521+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e326f2ef74b9e695582aa91", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e326f2ef74b9e695582aa91", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
